                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The privileging of masculinity in the use of speech, writing or modes of thought; phallocentrism expressed through language."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
