                                                "sense_id": "45966292-559d-3100-8c08-88848ab6e3f2",
                                                "text": "The task of this enquiry is to center on – and decenter – such defining institutions: phallogocentrism and compulsory heterosexuality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
